## 3. emit-x86-ssa REFUSED (1 fixture: aarch64_empty)

`aarch64_empty.oo` is an empty AArch64 fixture; the SSA path's typed-AST rejects it because the program has no body. This is correct behavior — the x86-ssa path should not be expected to compile AArch64-specific fixtures. No fix needed; the fixture is misfiled (lives in `fixtures/aarch64_*.oo` but the x86 backend is a different target).

